SUMMARY:Mark Schiff LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DTSTAMP:20260720T113558Z
DTSTART:20260720T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMark Schiff is a vetera
	n stand-up comedian with over four decades of experience making audiences 
	laugh across the country. A close friend and frequent collaborator of Jerr
	y Seinfeld\, Mark is widely respected in the comedy world for his clean\, 
	clever\, and deeply relatable humor. \nHis comedy draws from real life — f
	amily\, relationships\, aging\, and the absurdities of everyday existence 
	— delivered with the kind of warmth and precision that only a true comedy 
	craftsman can achieve. Mark has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Late Night 
	with David Letterman\, and numerous other television programs\, and has re
	leased multiple acclaimed stand-up specials. \nSeeing Mark Schiff live at 
	the Laugh Factory in Las Vegas is a treat for fans of classic\, well-craft
	ed stand-up comedy. His shows are consistently funny\, heartfelt\, and lea
	ve audiences feeling genuinely uplifted. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\,
	 July 20\, 2026 (runs through July 22)\nTime: 8:30 PM\nVenue: Laugh Factor
	y at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nS
	how Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Facto
	ry at Horseshoe Las Vegas is one of the premier comedy destinations on the
	 Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the iconic Horseshoe Hotel and Casino at 
	3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, this club is part of the legendary Laugh Factory b
	rand that has been a cornerstone of American stand-up comedy for decades. 
	\nThe venue features tiered seating with excellent sightlines\, a full-ser
	vice bar\, and an intimate atmosphere that puts you close to the action. T
	he Laugh Factory’s rotating roster of headliners ensures there’s always so
	mething new and exciting to see\, making it a must-visit for comedy fans o
	n the Strip. \nParking is available at the Horseshoe Las Vegas parking gar
	age. The venue is conveniently located on the Strip and easily accessible 
	from surrounding hotels and attractions. \nWhat to Expect\nMark Schiff’s L
	as Vegas engagement at the Laugh Factory is a multi-night stand-up showcas
	e featuring his signature blend of clean\, observational humor and persona
	l storytelling. Expect an evening of genuine laughs delivered by one of co
	medy’s most respected veterans. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes a
	nd may include an opening act. Mark’s warm stage presence and masterful ti
	ming create an atmosphere that feels both intimate and electric. This is t
	he kind of comedy show that reminds you why live stand-up is one of the gr
	eatest forms of entertainment. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $5
	5 (fees may apply) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official)
	. Don’t miss your chance to see a comedy legend live in Las Vegas! \nOffic
	ial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission
	 at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-schiff-
	live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-schiff-live-at-laugh-factory-las-
	vegas/
LOCATION:Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las
	 Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
