DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nSammy Obe
	id is a Lebanese-Palestinian American comedian born in Oakland\, Californi
	a\, who double-majored in Business and Mathematics at UC Berkeley — and th
	en turned down a job at Google to pursue stand-up comedy. That decision pa
	id off in a big way. \nObeid is best known as the host of 100 Humans on Ne
	tflix\, and has appeared on NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, America’s Got Tale
	nt\, and TBS’s Conan. He holds a world record for performing stand-up come
	dy 1\,001 nights in a row — a remarkable feat that was featured in both Ti
	me Magazine and The New York Times. \nSammy’s comedy is smart\, sharp\, an
	d deeply personal — blending his unique background in math and business wi
	th relatable observations about life\, culture\, and the human experience.
	 His shows are known for being intellectually engaging while remaining lau
	gh-out-loud funny from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, J
	uly 21\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 5:30 PM) \nVenue: Pittsburgh 
	Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120 \nAge Restriction: Ages 2
	1 and up \nNote: This is a one-night-only special event at the Pittsburgh 
	Improv. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Improv is located at 166 E. Brid
	ge Street in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. As pa
	rt of the nationally recognized Improv Comedy Club chain\, the Pittsburgh 
	Improv is one of the premier comedy venues in the region. \nThe club featu
	res a full-service restaurant and bar\, making it a perfect destination fo
	r a complete night out. The intimate showroom seats approximately 300 gues
	ts\, ensuring every seat has a great sightline to the stage. The venue’s w
	arm\, welcoming atmosphere is ideal for the kind of thoughtful\, engaging 
	comedy that Sammy Obeid delivers. \nParking is available nearby\, and the 
	venue is easily accessible from major highways. The Pittsburgh Improv cons
	istently brings top national touring comedians to the Pittsburgh area\, an
	d Sammy Obeid is a standout addition to their summer 2026 lineup. \nWhat t
	o Expect\nSammy Obeid delivers a stand-up performance that is as smart as 
	it is funny. Expect sharp observations\, personal storytelling\, and a com
	edian who can make complex ideas hilarious. This is a solo stand-up show —
	 expect 60–75 minutes of intelligent\, engaging comedy. \nSammy’s unique b
	ackground — from UC Berkeley math major to Netflix host to world record ho
	lder — gives him a perspective unlike any other comedian working today. Hi
	s shows are perfect for fans who love comedy that makes you think as much 
	as it makes you laugh. \nPlease note: This is an ages 21 and up event. Val
	id ID is required at the door. Third-party tickets will not be honored — p
	urchase only from authorized sellers. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $
	25 – $50 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through official channels and
	 resale marketplaces. This is a one-night-only show\, so purchase early to
	 secure your spot! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains a
	ffiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps
	://comedycalendar.com/event/sammy-obeid-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/\n\nFrom
	 Comedy Calendar
