SUMMARY:Mario Adrion LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DTSTAMP:20260720T113558Z
DTSTART:20260723T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nMario Adrion LIVE at Punch Line Irving\nGet ready 
	for a night of sharp\, internationally-flavored comedy as Mario Adrion tak
	es the stage at Punch Line Irving! The German-American comedian and social
	 media sensation brings his unique perspective on life\, culture\, and the
	 American experience to Irving\, Texas on July 23\, 2026. Don’t miss this 
	rising star of stand-up comedy! \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\
	, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Irving\nA
	ddress: 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039\nAge Requi
	rement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 bev
	erages per person \nAbout Mario Adrion\nMario Adrion is a German-American 
	comedian\, actor\, and social media personality who has amassed millions o
	f followers with his hilarious takes on cultural differences between Europ
	e and America. Known for his sharp wit and relatable storytelling\, Mario 
	has performed sold-out shows across the US and Europe\, bringing his uniqu
	e cross-cultural comedy to audiences worldwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilari
	ous cross-cultural comedy from a social media sensation\nSharp observation
	s on American vs. European life\nAn intimate comedy club experience at Pun
	ch Line Irving\nEngaging storytelling and crowd interaction\nFull bar serv
	ice with a 2-drink minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Irving is loca
	ted in the heart of Las Colinas at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, I
	rving\, TX. This premier comedy club offers an intimate atmosphere with fu
	ll bar service\, making it the perfect spot for a night out in the Dallas-
	Fort Worth area. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $32 
	and are available now. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per 
