	\nAge Requirement: 18+ (All shows are 18+ unless otherwise noted)\nParking
	: Available at Harrah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and surface lot. Up to 3 hours
	 free parking for locals. \nAbout Jay Reid\nJay Reid is a Las Vegas-raised
	 comedian and actor who rose to fame after winning Bill Bellamy’s “Who’s G
	ot Jokes?” on TV One. He has released three comedy specials including “L.M
	.A.O.” and “That Don’t Go Together” on Dry Bar+\, and has appeared on BET’
	s “Coming to the Stage” and Showtime’s “Ladies Night Out Comedy Special.” 
	His fourth special is on the way\, making this a must-see performance from
