	 cocktails and great vibes\nA performer with multiple TV specials and a pr
	oven track record\nOne of the hottest comedy nights on the Las Vegas Strip
	\n\nVenue Information\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is located at the LINQ P
	romenade on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate 325-seat venue with
	 a full bar and premium comedy entertainment nightly. The club features to
	p comedians from around the country in a fun\, upscale setting. \nTicket I
	nformation\nTickets start from $56. This is a general admission venue — se
