SUMMARY:Desi Banks: Your Favorite Cousin Tour LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260720T113558Z
DTSTART:20260724T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nDesi Bank
	s is the ultimate triple threat — actor\, stand-up comedian\, content crea
	tor\, and entrepreneur who is taking the entertainment world by storm. Wit
	h over 19 million fans across social media platforms\, Desi has built one 
	of the most loyal and engaged audiences in comedy today\, and his live sho
	ws are a direct reflection of that energy. \nIn 2024\, Desi embarked on hi
	s own 50-city headline tour\, selling nearly 52\,000 tickets. He has toure
	d alongside heavyweights like Mike Epps\, Deray Davis\, Kountry Wayne\, Ga
	ry Owen\, and Lavell Crawford\, and joined Martin Lawrence on the “Y’all K
	now What It Is!” tour in Las Vegas\, Los Angeles\, and Oakland. Kevin Hart
	 has publicly praised Desi as the “next great” talent in comedy. \nAs an a
	ctor\, Desi has appeared in major motion pictures including Lawrence Lamon
	t’s One of Them Days (produced by Issa Rae\, starring Keke Palmer and SZA)
	\, Will Packer’s Little\, and the indie-horror film Haunted Trail on BET+.
	 He is also the CEO and founder of Desi Banks Productions\, a creative pow
	erhouse that has produced over 3\,500 original videos and partnered with b
	rands including Meta\, Apple\, Beats by Dre\, and PrizePicks. \nEvent Deta
	ils\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 5:30 
	PM)\nVenue: Raleigh Improv\nAddress: 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 275
	19\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid ID required)\nNote: Two-item minimum purch
	ase required in the showroom for all guests. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleig
	h Improv is the Triangle area’s premier comedy club\, located in the heart
	 of Cary’s Parkside Town Commons. Part of the nationally recognized Improv
	 comedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv offers an intimate\, club-style at
	mosphere where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue features g
	eneral admission seating (first-come\, first-served) as well as premium bo
	oth options that include a $200 food and beverage credit. The full-service
	 bar and kitchen menu make it easy to enjoy dinner and drinks before and d
	uring the show. \nParking is available in the surrounding Parkside Town Co
	mmons shopping center lots. The venue is easily accessible from I-40 and U
	S-1\, making it convenient for guests coming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chape
	l Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat to Expect\nDesi Banks delivers a hi
	gh-energy\, crowd-pleasing stand-up performance packed with razor-sharp wi
	t\, hilarious personal stories\, and the kind of infectious comedic timing
	 that has made him one of the fastest-rising stars in the game. His Your F
	avorite Cousin Tour is a celebration of the relatable\, real-life humor th
	at his millions of fans have come to love. \nThis is a 21+ event with a li
	vely Friday night crowd. Arrive early to secure your preferred seats\, ord
	er from the full menu\, and get ready for an unforgettable night of live c
	omedy. VIP ticket options are available for a premium viewing experience. 
	\nNo cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording is permitted during
	 the performance. All sales are final. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: 
	$30 – $95 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (officia
	l) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post c
	ontains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
	\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/desi-banks-your-favorite-cousin-tour-
	live-at-raleigh-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/desi-banks-your-favorite-cousin-tour-l
	ive-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, Unite
	d States Of America
