DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nDylan Carlino: If I Was A Girl Tour LIVE at Cob
	b’s Comedy Club\nDylan Carlino is bringing his massively popular If I Was 
	A Girl tour to Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco for a special night of 
	stand-up comedy. Known for his viral online sketches that have racked up o
	ver 100 million views\, Dylan delivers sharp\, relatable humor that has ma
	de him one of the fastest-rising comedians in the country. \nEvent Details
	\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)
	\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\
	, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minim
	um: Two-drink minimum per person \nAbout Dylan Carlino\nDylan Carlino is a
	 comedian and content creator best known for his viral “If I Was a Girl…” 
	series\, which has amassed over 100 million views across social media plat
	forms. His sharp observational humor and relatable storytelling have earne
	d him a massive following and a reputation as one of comedy’s most excitin
	g emerging voices. He has performed at clubs and theaters across the count
	ry\, building a loyal fanbase with his energetic and authentic style. \nWh
	at to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy featuring Dylan Carlino’
	s signature viral humor\nMaterial from his popular “If I Was A Girl” serie
	s and beyond\nAn intimate club setting at the legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club
	\nDoors open one hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nF
	ull bar service with a two-drink minimum per person\nAn unforgettable nigh
	t of laughs in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Informati
	on\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s premier comedy venues\, l
	ocated at 915 Columbus Avenue in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood. The
	 club has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and offers an intimat
	e atmosphere with excellent sightlines from every seat. Street parking is 
	available nearby\, and the venue is accessible via public transit. \nTicke
	t Information\nTickets start from $46 and are available through Ticketmast
	er (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). Ticket prices may vary b
	ased on availability. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges unless
	 the event is cancelled or postponed. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets
	\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purcha
